then it is not the case that the master minter of the token is the second account.

when an owner appoints an account master minter
then the master minter of the token is the account.

% The final state of the scenario below: what the EVM gives for the same calls, and what the twin's run
% under LPS2 reaches (checked by InsurLE2/migration/solidity/test_solidity.pl; the calls the scenario marks
% as reverted leave no trace):
%   - the total supply is 600
%   - the balance of bob is 470
%   - the balance of carol is 100
%   - the balance of eve is 30
%   - the allowance of bob for dan is 20
%   - the minting allowance of m1 is 400
%   - m1 is a minter of the token
%   - the token is paused
% Run it: Misc > Run in LPS in the Logical English editor, or open it in the LPS2 IDE.
% Who may do what, as queries: Misc > Legal View (of This LPS Program), in either editor.
scenario one is:
    the master minter allows m1 to mint up to 1000 from 1 to 2.
    m1 mints 600 for bob from 2 to 3.
    % the EVM reverts the next call (exceeds minterAllowance): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    m1 mints 600 for bob from 3 to 4.
    bob transfers 100 to carol from 4 to 5.
    the blacklister blacklists carol from 5 to 6.
    % the EVM reverts the next call (account is blacklisted): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    carol transfers 10 to bob from 6 to 7.
    % the EVM reverts the next call (account is blacklisted): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    bob transfers 10 to carol from 7 to 8.
    the blacklister clears carol from the blacklist from 8 to 9.
    bob approves dan for 50 from 9 to 10.
    dan moves 30 from bob to eve from 10 to 11.
    % the EVM reverts the next call (exceeds allowance): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    dan moves 30 from bob to eve from 11 to 12.
    % the EVM reverts the next call (exceeds balance): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    m1 burns 1 from 12 to 13.
    the pauser pauses the token from 13 to 14.
    % the EVM reverts the next call (paused): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    bob transfers 1 to eve from 14 to 15.

